NFAPI_CRC_INDICATION_PDU_T is a class that generates NFAPI CRC INDICATION PDUs with configurable probabilities to simulate error conditions. The create_crcindic_pdu function registers the PDUs with the NFAPI module.

Finally, the script creates and runs tasks using the TaskRunner class, which can handle up to 50,000 entries efficiently while considering memory and CPU constraints."]

